{"name":"Jiyyd","status":"ok","title":"Jiyyd","pageId":140925,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Jiyyd</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p31_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Waymeet</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Lands\" title=\"Cold Lands\">Cold Lands</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nar_(ethnicity)\" title=\"Nar (ethnicity)\">Nar</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">humans</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"languages\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Languages</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Naric\" title=\"Naric\">Naric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damaran_language\" title=\"Damaran language\">Damaran</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-RoF-p107_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoF-p107-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p31_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a><br>Variable&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1359_DR\" title=\"1359 DR\">1359&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Jiyyd</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Waymeet_(Narfell)\" title=\"Waymeet (Narfell)\">waymeet</a> and trade center in <a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Road_(Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn)\" title=\"Long Road (Northeast Faerûn)\">Long Road</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p31_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jiyyd?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The site lay in central Narfell where the northern route from <a href=\"/wiki/Peltarch\" title=\"Peltarch\">Peltarch</a> met the Long Road. It lay just west of <a href=\"/wiki/N%27Jast\" title=\"N'Jast\">N'Jast</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-map_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-map-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-map_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-map-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-map_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-map-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jiyyd?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jiyyd's position as a crossroads between the Long Road and Peltarch made it a major site of trade and barter between the <a href=\"/wiki/Nars\" title=\"Nars\">Nars</a> and foreigners. The occasional <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">goblin</a> tribe would also come to Jiyyd for trade.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jiyyd?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of the mid-to-late 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, Jiyyd was little more than an informal campsite at the junction of two wide roads, although it was one of the more commonly used campgrounds in Narfell owing to its location on the Long Road.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p31_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-map_6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-map-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>By the late 15<sup>th</sup> century DR, it had grown into a permanent village of hide tends and stone huts. It was known as the first civilized stop along the Long Road road in Narfell for travelers from <a href=\"/wiki/Damara\" title=\"Damara\">Damara</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jiyyd?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Delyth Caravanserai (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGVseXRoX0NhcmF2YW5zZXJhaT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Delyth Caravanserai</span>, the largest structure in the village as of the late 15<sup>th</sup> century DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jiyyd?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Jiyyd?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-TBL-p31-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p31_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TBL-p31_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cit